    "retrieval": true,
    "retrieval@1": true,
    "buttons": true
   },
   "answer": "Before filing a port entry report on Port-MIS, you need to complete the user registration application (ID and password registration) [1]. \n\n1. Submit a user registration application (ID and password registration) [1]  \n2. Check if the vessel information is already registered  \n   - If not, submit a vessel information report (new or amended) [1]  \n   - If yes, proceed to check the vessel’s entry and exit history (voyage confirmation) [1]  \n3. Submit the initial or amended port entry report for coastal or ocean-going ships [1]  \n4. Confirm whether cargo is being discharged  \n   - If yes, submit an integrated cargo report and port facility usage report [1]  \n   - If no, submit a port facility usage application and the final port entry report [1]  \n5. Confirm whether cargo is being loaded  \n   - If yes, submit an integrated cargo report and port facility usage report [1]  \n   - If no, submit the initial, amended, or final port departure report [1]  \n6. Complete the process [1]"
  },
